# The build context is the ROS packages and nothing else. Anything reachable from
# the context is part of the COPY cache key, so a file the build never reads still
# forces a full rebuild — including the __pycache__ and config/apriltags that the
# running containers write back into the repo through the compose bind mounts.
*
!husarion_ugv_*

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/apriltags
**/*.md
**/*.rst
